{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/EmO5ze-9UH0dnzHhHvyK_g","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:32.085742+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/EmO5ze-9UH0dnzHhHvyK_g","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_gif/aTt6PMJavtpiahibo4Ch89qh5qX0dBQ2RrQsGVvsF6dFLibgPYMDLhhdQY7OIH102EvtwSCXTkgdicKFPdEKMlVRIw/640?wx_fmt=gif&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aTt6PMJavtpiahibo4Ch89qh5qX0dBQ2RrmDcdSHJoRqOGVWjR0pFvatHJRicKMHZkDr32uITJ01X76PXWj3YZXcA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aTt6PMJavtpiahibo4Ch89qh5qX0dBQ2RrEgbGumLFSAPWYVozUS1ApcZVm6129RHHbCica8rRIKLmQwvELKhrBYA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aTt6PMJavtpiahibo4Ch89qh5qX0dBQ2RrNulgicXwYmxv8MMTG5gacFppqZ449qEf1zHI31xYvHGK8hREQyJYNiaQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aTt6PMJavtpiahibo4Ch89qh5qX0dBQ2Rrvh8ywBxibBkOHibGfLlfqvAWicJXllC8a75jqxicKDJTpyYXBIaDFaLpRg/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aTt6PMJavtpiahibo4Ch89qh5qX0dBQ2RrEicYcXCu0IUlvXDjquazj8bo8NhSyy6AC71iag51AcKhHPr0uuG3n1uA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section></section><section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aTt6PMJavtpiahibo4Ch89qh5qX0dBQ2RrGoibCgVNwS6wNhEFC93n9mjr1EBuTcoiaEYXic07mos5lvsiac4ALttJaQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section></section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>夏令营活动是优秀本科生对学院零距离、全方位了解的重要渠道和平台，为促进优秀本科生之间的交流，吸引优秀青年学子走进山农，了解山农化学学科和实验室，增强科研兴趣、拓宽学术视野，感受导师风采，体验农大魅力，发掘选拔校内外优秀应届本科生到学院继续深造。经研究决定，山东农业大学化学与材料科学学院2025年将举办“</span><strong><span>优秀大学生化学暑期夏令营</span></strong><span>”，诚意邀请全国各高校相关专业优秀本科生参加。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>01</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>学院简介</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aTt6PMJavtpiahibo4Ch89qh5qX0dBQ2RrEicYcXCu0IUlvXDjquazj8bo8NhSyy6AC71iag51AcKhHPr0uuG3n1uA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/aTt6PMJavtpiahibo4Ch89qh5qX0dBQ2Rr79BZZ9FOrP7QHKxM56onPabKWdPDlcgrJJxuvLxHuiat6Ee1TFKLqAA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><p><span>山东农大化学与材料科学学院成立于2002年，拥有应用化学、材料化学（省一流专业）、制药工程本科专业，化学一级学科硕士点和材料与化工专硕点（联合培养博士）。</span><strong><span>化学学科进入ESI全球前1%</span></strong><span>。师资含国家级/省级人才6人及省青创团队5个。2025年本科读研率50%，就业率全校前列。</span></p><p><span><span>学院依托农科优势，聚焦“化学+”（农业分析、农用材料等），</span></span><strong><span>建有6个省部级和行业平台</span></strong><span><span>。拥有国家一流课程、省级精品课程，获省教学成果一等奖。</span></span><strong><span>“十四五”承担国家级项目等58项（经费3500万）</span></strong><span><span>，</span></span><strong><span>发表论文210篇</span></strong><span><span>，</span></span><strong><span>获专利20余项、转化12项</span></strong><span><span>。</span></span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>02</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><b><span>时间地点</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aTt6PMJavtpiahibo4Ch89qh5qX0dBQ2RrEicYcXCu0IUlvXDjquazj8bo8NhSyy6AC71iag51AcKhHPr0uuG3n1uA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>1.时间：</span><strong><span><span>2025年7月2日-7月3日</span></span></strong></p><p><span>2.活动内容：</span></p><p><span>化学学院2025年大学生夏令营活动内容包括： 开营式、专业方向导师见面会、课题组交流互动等。</span></p><p><strong><span>7月2日</span></strong></p><p><span>下午：报到。</span></p><p><strong><span>7月3日</span></strong></p><p><span>上午：夏令营开营式、学院整体情况介绍、营员自我介绍和读研规划（可自愿准备5分钟内PPT）、专业方向导师见面交流会。</span></p><p><span>下午：参观科研实验室、闭营离校。</span></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>03</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请条件</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aTt6PMJavtpiahibo4Ch89qh5qX0dBQ2RrEicYcXCu0IUlvXDjquazj8bo8NhSyy6AC71iag51AcKhHPr0uuG3n1uA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.坚持四项基本原则，品德优良，遵纪守法，具有创新意识和团队精神，在校期间未受过任何法纪处分，身心健康；</span></p><p><span>2.学习成绩优秀，综合排名前50%，英语水平良好；</span></p><p><span>3.拟于2026年本科毕业的各高校化学、化工、材料、制药等相关或相近专业的大学生</span><span><span>；</span></span></p><p><span>4.有志于从事科学研究工作，品德良好，有较强的表达和沟通能力</span><span><span>。</span></span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>04</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请材料</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aTt6PMJavtpiahibo4Ch89qh5qX0dBQ2RrEicYcXCu0IUlvXDjquazj8bo8NhSyy6AC71iag51AcKhHPr0uuG3n1uA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.</span><strong><span>山东农业大学化学与材料科学学院2025年优秀大学生暑期夏令营申请表（附件1）</span></strong><span>1份（文件二维码见下方），应如实填写各项信息并由学校相关部门签字盖章；</span></p><p><span>2.</span><strong><span>本科在读期间成绩单（含学习成绩排名，需学校教务部门签字及盖章）</span></strong><span>1份；</span></p><p><span>3.</span><strong><span>英语CET-4/6成绩单</span></strong><span>；</span></p><p><span>4.</span><strong><span>其他证明材料</span></strong><span>（已发表论文的首页、其他各类等级证书、奖状、其他证明材料、较厚的论文及出版物）；</span></p><p><span>5.</span><strong><span>学生证</span></strong><span>（在读学期需注册完整）；</span></p></section></section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aTt6PMJavtpiahibo4Ch89qh5qX0dBQ2RrVspMuu4Kce3fp0vvXuAVt3ZiasibGhH15n9kmCEWI4zUNdPG0zibvdsJA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>山东农业大学化学与材料科学学院</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>2025年优秀大学生暑期夏令营申请表（附件1）</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>扫码下载</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>05</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请流程</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aTt6PMJavtpiahibo4Ch89qh5qX0dBQ2RrEicYcXCu0IUlvXDjquazj8bo8NhSyy6AC71iag51AcKhHPr0uuG3n1uA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>1.报名</span></p><p><span>需将上述材料</span><strong><span>按照顺序</span></strong><span>扫描至一个PDF文件中，并以“</span><strong><span>夏令营报名化学学院+本科所在学校+本科所学专业+姓名</span></strong><span>”命名发送至</span><span><span>1357475822@qq.com</span></span><span><span>。本校2026届本科生可直接到</span><strong><span>山东农业大学（岱宗校区）</span></strong><strong><span>文理大楼703</span></strong><span>报名。材料提交的</span><strong><span>截止</span></strong><strong><span>时间为2025年7月1日</span></strong><span>。</span></span></p><p><span>2.审核入围</span></p><p><span>申请材料的审核及营员的入选工作由山东农业大学化学与材料科学学院审核人负责。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>06</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>其他事项</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aTt6PMJavtpiahibo4Ch89qh5qX0dBQ2RrEicYcXCu0IUlvXDjquazj8bo8NhSyy6AC71iag51AcKhHPr0uuG3n1uA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aTt6PMJavtpiahibo4Ch89qh5qX0dBQ2Rrl6TlPzJGknngCI17Bkm7C7s1ezs0uKoB166OhwYe7UQJXXVNMvoLLQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong></strong></p><p><strong><span>营员评选及相关事项</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>学院将根据申请材料、专家组考核结果及入营表现进行综合考核，评价等级为优秀、合格等等次。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aTt6PMJavtpiahibo4Ch89qh5qX0dBQ2Rrl6TlPzJGknngCI17Bkm7C7s1ezs0uKoB166OhwYe7UQJXXVNMvoLLQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong></strong></p><p><strong><span>服务保障</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1.学院将为全程参加夏令营并且考核合格的营员发放城际交通补贴（需提供活动举办期间往返泰安的实名的交通凭证：普通硬座火车票、汽车票）；</span></p><p><span>2.学院将为营员统一发放餐饮补贴；</span></p><p><span>3.学院将为营员提供统一住宿（驻泰高校学生除外）。</span></p></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aTt6PMJavtpiahibo4Ch89qh5qX0dBQ2Rrl6TlPzJGknngCI17Bkm7C7s1ezs0uKoB166OhwYe7UQJXXVNMvoLLQ/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><strong></strong></p><p><strong><span>有关事项</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><p><span>1.申请者的申请材料务必真实，如有不实，将取消其营员资格，复试结果作废；</span></p><p><span>2.营员必须遵守我校相关规定，在参加夏令营活动中服从统一安排，保障自身安全；</span></p><p><span>3.营员报到后须全程参加夏令营活动，擅自离营者，学院将不提供相关资助；</span></p><p><span>4.夏令营活动期间营员要与学院签订安全协议书，学校为营员统一购买交通及意外伤害险。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>07</span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>联系方式</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aTt6PMJavtpiahibo4Ch89qh5qX0dBQ2RrEicYcXCu0IUlvXDjquazj8bo8NhSyy6AC71iag51AcKhHPr0uuG3n1uA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><p><span>山东农业大学化学与材料科学学院研究生工作办公室</span></p><p><span>联系人：周晔</span></p><p><span>联系电话：8248790</span></p></section></section></section></section><section><p><span><span>山东农业大学化学与材料科学学院</span></span></p><p><span><span>2025年6月23日</span></span></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section>