" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/aTt6PMJavtpiahibo4Ch89qh5qX0dBQ2RrAkwxu6rMzFeam60cRMwZnuemEu7UM3GcYhsaasXJIuvYqyZB7uaM9Q/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA4MzcxNDc3Mg==&amp;mid=2651017100&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=daaf8867579a3cd33bacf45abce0da32&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/aTt6PMJavtpiahibo4Ch89qh5qX0dBQ2RrOich82fZZlQYq4V6Rbh8ZKm5jVJ7qS3oZUpnWvu91mciaIicJrA6M1CVQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></a></section></section><section><section><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA4MzcxNDc3Mg==&amp;mid=2651016883&amp;idx=1&amp;sn=f08be2e80ac7126386c83a1f7d0677fd&amp;scene=21#wechat_redirect\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_png/aTt6PMJavtpiahibo4Ch89qh5qX0dBQ2Rrj62SE8eGOXsaz4iaIwYp7puKg7KaaIQCHT2tYtkSLI78Ow7b82ozFCA/640?wx_fmt=png&amp;from=appmsg\"/></span></a></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"7e2e46194898f1ca575d4198714fdb037c56425e181570abefbf0683d1b9f4bd","textLength":1645,"sourceSha256":"99cffad8c6564805e5c17cc6b190f85b90ebac35777f5214a77dfc43ad286061","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailableMedia":[],"id":"syp-286b5c2158e947790e26","title":"2025年山东农业大学化学与材料科学学院2025年“全国优秀大学生化学暑期夏令营”的通知","capturedAt":"2026-11-15T16:58:32.085742+00:00"}
